    <div class="reveal" style="margin-top:56px;">
      <div class="eyebrow-dark" style="color:#7FE6B8;">Our Service Standard</div>
      <div class="stats">
        <div><div class="stat-num">14</div><div class="stat-label">working days to first qualified shortlist</div></div>
        <div><div class="stat-num">Top 3</div><div class="stat-label">technically proficient candidates, guaranteed</div></div>
        <div><div class="stat-num">90</div><div class="stat-label">day replacement guarantee window</div></div>
      </div>
      <p class="form-note" style="color:#7A7E86;margin-top:10px;">Operating commitments for every engagement — not historical claims. PSE is a newly registered advisory boutique in the Kingdom.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     SLIDE 03 — OUR STORY, VISION & MISSION  (pinned cinematic)
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="slide slide-pin" id="story">
  <div class="story-bg" style="background-image:url('/img/story/story-02-reach.jpg');"></div>
  <div class="story-overlay"></div>
  <div class="slide-content wrap">
    <div class="story-index"><span class="line"><span>03 — Our Story</span></span></div>
    <h2 class="story-title"><span class="line"><span>Saudi Arabia doesn't have a female-talent shortage. It has a female-talent discovery problem.</span></span></h2>

    <div class="vm-split line">
      <span>
        <div class="vm-card-dark">
          <span class="icon-badge"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'eye' }) %></span>
          <h3>Our Vision</h3>
          <p>To be the Kingdom's indispensable partner in qualitative national localization — connecting the top tier of specialized Saudi female professionals to roles that carry real technical and strategic weight.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="vm-card-dark">
          <span class="icon-badge"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'target' }) %></span>
          <h3>Our Mission</h3>
          <p>We use structured technical and psychometric assessment to help Vision 2030 organizations identify, place, and retain specialized Saudi female talent — with evidence, not guesswork.</p>
        </div>
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     SLIDE 04 — HOW WE WORK  (two-column, always-visible)
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="slide slide-flow slide-dark" id="how-we-work">
  <div class="story-bg" style="background-image:url('/img/story/story-03-stairs.jpg');"></div>
  <div class="story-overlay story-overlay-heavy"></div>
  <div class="slide-content wrap">
    <div class="story-index reveal"><span class="line"><span>04 — How We Work</span></span></div>
    <h2 class="story-title reveal"><span class="line"><span>One framework. Two audiences. Zero guesswork.</span></span></h2>
    <p class="story-text reveal" style="margin-bottom:40px;"><span class="line"><span>How we work with clients, and how we vet candidates — side by side.</span></span></p>

    <div class="work-columns reveal">
      <div class="work-col">
        <div class="work-col-head">
          <span class="icon-badge"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'briefcase' }) %></span>
          <h3>For Clients</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="work-subhead">Service Models</div>
        <div class="work-item">
          <h4>Strategic Executive Search</h4>
          <p>High-level retained advisory for C-suite and director roles, requiring extreme discretion and access to the rarest female leadership talent.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="work-item">
          <h4>Contract Staffing Advisory</h4>
          <p>Rapid supply of specialized Saudi female talent for fixed-term projects or immediate operational capacity injection.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="work-item">
          <h4>Permanent Placement Advisory</h4>
          <p>Sourcing candidates for long-term, direct employment within the client's organizational structure.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="work-subhead">Risk Mitigation</div>
        <div class="work-item">
          <h4>Placement Guarantee</h4>
          <p>A free replacement search if the hired candidate resigns or is terminated for performance reasons within the agreed guarantee period.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="work-item">
          <h4>Focus on Value</h4>
          <p>Compliance with qualitative localization goals — never placing an unqualified candidate in a strategic role just to meet a quota.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="work-item">
          <h4>Built to Last</h4>
          <p>A lean operating model built for long-term stability, so our commitment to your mandate doesn't depend on deal volume.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="work-col">
        <div class="work-col-head">
          <span class="icon-badge"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'users' }) %></span>
          <h3>For Candidates</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="work-subhead">The PSE Differentiator</div>
        <div class="work-item">
          <h4>Deep Technical Assessment</h4>
          <p>We move beyond CV filtering. Candidates are pre-vetted against industry-specific technical criteria to ensure immediate operational capability from day one.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="work-item">
          <h4>Vision 2030 Alignment Scoring</h4>
          <p>We evaluate experience in Giga-Projects or direct contribution to national KPIs, ensuring candidates meet the qualitative standards of the localization mandate.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="work-item">
          <h4>Speed in Scarcity</h4>
          <p>Continuous, focused talent pool mapping lets us generate a viable, vetted shortlist faster than generalist firms starting from scratch for niche requests.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

